WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.899
Christy's family was moving. She was very sad.

2
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:09.943
Christy did not want to leave her friends.

3
00:00:09.944 --> 00:00:15.349
"Don't worry, honey. You'll make new friends," Mom said.

4
00:00:15.350 --> 00:00:22.886
"You'll love the new house too," said Dad. But Christy was still sad.

5
00:00:22.887 --> 00:00:28.369
Christy did not like her new school. The kids did not speak to her.

6
00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:34.847
They did not play with her. Christy did not have any friends.

7
00:00:34.848 --> 00:00:38.583
"What did you do at school today?" asked Dad.

8
00:00:38.584 --> 00:00:47.836
"I'm sure there are many nice kids in your class," said Mom. Her parents were very worried.

9
00:00:47.837 --> 00:00:54.274
One day after school, Christy was walking home alone. She saw a little park.

10
00:00:54.275 --> 00:01:00.239
"I am going to take a walk in that park," Christy said to herself.

11
00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:08.590
The next day Christy was smiling. "Can I play in the park after school?" Christy asked cheerfully.

12
00:01:08.591 --> 00:01:11.713
"With who, Christy?" asked Mom.

13
00:01:11.714 --> 00:01:15.477
"With my new friend," smiled Christy.

14
00:01:15.478 --> 00:01:20.771
"Of course you can," Mom and Dad said happily.

15
00:01:20.772 --> 00:01:25.114
During lunchtime Christy ate only half of her ham sandwich.

16
00:01:25.115 --> 00:01:31.130
All day long she was smiling. Christy could not wait for school to be over.

17
00:01:31.131 --> 00:01:37.203
She wanted to go to the park to see her new friend.

18
00:01:37.204 --> 00:01:40.476
"Did you have fun in the park?" asked Dad.

19
00:01:40.477 --> 00:01:43.976
"Oh yes," answered Christy.

20
00:01:43.977 --> 00:01:47.307
"What's your friend's name?" asked Mom.

21
00:01:47.308 --> 00:01:52.133
"Hammie!" Christy giggled.

22
00:01:52.134 --> 00:01:56.639
On Saturday Christy went to the park to see her new friend.

23
00:01:56.640 --> 00:02:03.310
"Do you want some of my sandwich? No one at school wants to be my friend.

24
00:02:03.311 --> 00:02:08.414
You're the only friend I have, Hammie."

25
00:02:08.415 --> 00:02:11.544
Christy was helping her mom make dinner.

26
00:02:11.545 --> 00:02:15.908
"Why don't you invite your friend for dinner?" Mom asked.

27
00:02:15.909 --> 00:02:21.336
"Uh, I think he's shy," Christy answered quickly.

28
00:02:21.337 --> 00:02:27.163
"Christy, is your friend a boy?" Mother said with surprise.

29
00:02:27.164 --> 00:02:34.281
"Excuse me, I have to get something from my room!"

30
00:02:34.282 --> 00:02:37.513
"What's going on?" asked Dad.

31
00:02:37.514 --> 00:02:42.345
"Christy's new friend Hammie is a boy!" Mom said.

32
00:02:42.346 --> 00:02:52.064
"A boy! You mean Christy has a boyfriend?" said Dad. Christy's parents were worried once again.

33
00:02:52.065 --> 00:02:55.749
One day there was a new girl in Christy's class.

34
00:02:55.750 --> 00:03:02.269
"Class, this is Mina. Her family just moved here," said Mrs. Peters.

35
00:03:02.270 --> 00:03:07.584
"Mina, go and sit next to Christy."

36
00:03:07.585 --> 00:03:11.784
"Hi, Christy! Can I sit here?" asked Mina.

37
00:03:11.785 --> 00:03:20.667
"Sure," said Christy. The two girls began talking.

38
00:03:20.668 --> 00:03:24.358
"Let's walk home together!" said Mina.

39
00:03:24.359 --> 00:03:28.975
"Well, I have to meet my friend," said Christy.

40
00:03:28.976 --> 00:03:32.655
"Do you want to meet my friend?"

41
00:03:32.656 --> 00:03:36.562
The two girls chatted all the way to the park.

42
00:03:36.563 --> 00:03:42.234
It was already dark outside. Christy was not home yet.

43
00:03:42.235 --> 00:03:44.662
Her mom and dad were very worried.

44
00:03:44.663 --> 00:03:48.389
They knew she was at the park with Hammie.

45
00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:53.516
"Do you know what time it is, young lady?" Dad said angrily.

46
00:03:53.517 --> 00:03:59.313
"I'm sorry. I was in the park . . . " began Christy.

47
00:03:59.314 --> 00:04:05.165
"We know Hammie is your boyfriend!" shouted Mom and Dad together.

48
00:04:05.166 --> 00:04:10.289
"Go to your room! You are in big trouble!"

49
00:04:10.290 --> 00:04:18.824
Christy's parents were very upset. They did not know what to do. Then the phone rang.

50
00:04:18.825 --> 00:04:22.696
"My name is Mina. I'm Christy's friend."

51
00:04:22.697 --> 00:04:29.520
"I'm sorry, Mina, but Christy can't come to the phone right now," said Mom.

52
00:04:29.521 --> 00:04:37.740
"Can you tell Christy that I am going to bring some extra sandwiches for Hammie tomorrow?" Mina said.

53
00:04:37.741 --> 00:04:43.179
"You know Hammie? Tell me all about him. What does he look like?

54
00:04:43.180 --> 00:04:47.695
How old is he?" Christy's mom was getting upset again.

55
00:04:47.696 --> 00:04:52.321
"Hammie is a raccoon," said Mina.

56
00:04:52.322 --> 00:04:58.661
"Christy, we're so sorry for shouting at you." Mom hugged Christy.

57
00:04:58.662 --> 00:05:03.460
"We didn't know Hammie was a raccoon," said Dad.

58
00:05:03.461 --> 00:05:07.879
"We thought he was your secret boyfriend," said Mom.

59
00:05:07.880 --> 00:05:13.276
"I was so lonely until I met Hammie in the park," said Christy.

60
00:05:13.277 --> 00:05:21.077
"Every day he came to play with me. He was my only friend."

61
00:05:21.078 --> 00:05:24.915
The next day Christy went with Mina and her parents to the park.

62
00:05:24.916 --> 00:05:28.682
Soon Hammie came to say hello to his friends.

63
00:05:28.683 --> 00:05:34.532
"Mom, Dad, this is Hammie, my old friend," Christy said.

64
00:05:34.533 --> 00:05:41.230
"And this is Mina, my new friend."

